<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-AUSTRALIAN AGOSTINO TO JOIN 1860 MUNICH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRALIAN AGOSTINO TO JOIN 1860 MUNICH.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian international Paul Agostino will join German first division 1860 Munich from English second division Bristol City next season on a three-year contract, 1860 chairman Karl-Heinz Wildmoser said on Saturday.</p>
</text>
